<title>USA: Mazda October U.S. car sales fall.</title>
<headline>Mazda October U.S. car sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mazda Motor Corp</p>
<p>			Oct 1-31, 1996     Oct 1-31, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	     5,732	     7,236	    -23.7</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	   2,639	     3,084	    -17.6</p>
<p> Import Car		 5,534	     7,492	    -28.9</p>
<p> Import Truck	     1,067	     1,100	     -6.6</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Oct 31, 1996 Jan 1-Oct 31, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    75,449	    93,210	    -19.7</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  36,519	    39,347	     -7.9</p>
<p> Import Car		85,797	   104,284	    -18.4</p>
<p> Import Truck	    11,684	    12,688	     -8.6</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 27 in latest month vs 26, 258 for year to date vs 256 in year ago.</p>
</text>
